<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/renal_perfusion_pressure> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/gfr> .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Arenal_perfusion_pressure%3Apositive%3Agfr> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/renal_perfusion_pressure> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/gfr> ; pmo:sign "+"
