    ; pmo:mechanism "PAH hydroxylates phenylalanine to tyrosine; phenylalanine is the SUBSTRATE, so ∂[Phe]/∂(PAH activity) < 0 — more enzyme clears Phe, LoF (activity DOWN) => Phe accumulates (PKU)."
    .
