    ; pmo:causalEvidence "genetic_lof_gof"
    ; dcterms:source "Boron & Boulpaep Medical Physiology (hepatic uptake of bilirubin, OATP1B1/1B3); Harrison's Principles of Internal Medicine, 'Bilirubin metabolism' (Rotor-syndrome impaired uptake -> conjugated/unconjugated hyperbilirubinemia)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "hepatocyte sinusoidal uptake of albumin-bound unconjugated bilirubin via OATP1B1/1B3 (SLCO1B1/1B3) clears it from plasma; higher uptake lowers plasma unconjugated bilirubin"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepatic_bilirubin_uptake> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepatic_bilirubin_conjugation> .
