<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Aelovl2_activity%3Anegative%3Aplasma_arachidonic_acid> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/elovl2_activity> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_arachidonic_acid> ; pmo:sign "-"
