    ; dcterms:source "PMID 17186413; (Abstract; Clinical, enzymatic and molecular characterization of nine new patients with MLYCD deficiency); “For all, detection of elevated malonic acid in urine (+/- increased C3DC acylcarnitine by analysis employing tandem mass spectrometry) led to pursuit of enzyme studies.” | MLYCD deficiency elevates malonic acid and C3DC (malonyl)carnitine, so do(MLYCD down) raises malonylcarnitine: enzyme activity --(-)--> malonylcarnitine. [citations PubMed-verified]"
