    ; pmo:mechanism "elevated intracellular H2O2 (oxidant) -> disposition to oxidize the ferrous heme iron of oxyhemoglobin -> Fe2+ -> Fe3+ oxidation process -> increased methemoglobin (ferric, non-O2-carrying) concentration"
