<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Aplasma_insulin%3Anegative%3Aplasma_potassium> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_insulin> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_potassium> ; pmo:sign "-"
