    ; pmo:mechanism "glucocorticoid induction of gluconeogenic enzymes (PEPCK, G6Pase) + substrate (amino-acid/glycerol) supply"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/cortisol> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/lipolysis_rate> .
