<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_insulin> obo:RO_0002305 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepatic_gluconeogenesis> .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Aplasma_insulin%3Anegative%3Ahepatic_gluconeogenesis> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_insulin> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepatic_gluconeogenesis> ; pmo:sign "-"
