    ; pmo:mechanism "insulin represses PEPCK/G6Pase transcription and raises fructose-2,6-bisphosphate, suppressing gluconeogenesis"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_insulin> obo:RO_0002305 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepatic_glycogenolysis> .
