    ; pmo:mechanism "plasma iron circulates bound to transferrin; rising plasma iron at fixed transferrin raises fractional transferrin saturation (TSAT)"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/transferrin_saturation> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepcidin> .
