    ; pmo:mechanism "high diferric-transferrin saturation signals via TfR2/HFE and BMP6-HJV-SMAD to upregulate hepatic HAMP transcription (closes the iron-sensing negative-feedback loop)"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_iron> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/ferritin_stores> .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Aplasma_iron%3Apositive%3Aferritin_stores> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_iron> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/ferritin_stores> ; pmo:sign "+"
