    ; dcterms:source "Masison2022 BioModels MODEL2211030002 (ferritin iron sequestration; doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0281401); Boron & Boulpaep"
    ; pmo:mechanism "surplus plasma iron is taken up by hepatocytes and macrophages and sequestered as ferritin; higher iron availability raises stored iron and ferritin"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/ferritin_stores> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepcidin> .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Aferritin_stores%3Apositive%3Ahepcidin> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/ferritin_stores> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepcidin> ; pmo:sign "+"
