    ; pmo:mechanism "erythroblasts secrete erythroferrone (ERFE) which sequesters BMP2/6 and inhibits hepatic BMP-SMAD signaling, suppressing hepcidin transcription to mobilize iron for erythropoiesis"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/erythropoietin> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/erythropoietic_iron_demand> .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Aerythropoietin%3Apositive%3Aerythropoietic_iron_demand> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/erythropoietin> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/erythropoietic_iron_demand> ; pmo:sign "+"
