    ; pmo:mechanism "ACO2 produces cis-aconitate from citrate; ACO2 deficiency reduces plasma cis-aconitate (PMID 28463998: 36.9-fold decrease). More ACO2 activity => more aconitate produced => higher plasma aconitate."
