    ; dcterms:source "Mitochondrial complex II deficiency (SDHA; OMIM 252011): urine organic acids show elevated succinic acid; SDH-deficient tumors show high succinate (PMC5219629); Succinate Dehydrogenase Deficiency review (PMC7660022): evaluation of urine organic acids shows significantly elevated succinic acid; Lehninger Principles of Biochemistry Ch. 16 (SDH, TCA step 6: succinate -> fumarate) | intervention: do(SDH/SDHA loss-of-function)"
