    ; dcterms:source "SSADH deficiency (ALDH5A1; OMIM 271980): the hallmark laboratory finding is elevated 4-hydroxybutyric (gamma-hydroxybutyric) acid in urine (GeneReviews NBK1195; NORD rare disease profile; SSADH Association); Saudubray, Inborn Metabolic Diseases; Blau, Physician's Guide to Inherited Metabolic Diseases | intervention: do(SSADH / ALDH5A1 loss-of-function)"
