    ; dcterms:source "D-glyceric aciduria (GLYCTK; OMIM 220120): D-glycerate accumulates in urine, plasma, and CSF (Saudubray, Inborn Metabolic Diseases — D-glyceric aciduria: neurological phenotype with D-glycerate in CSF); Scriver's OMMBID | intervention: do(GLYCTK / D-glycerate kinase loss-of-function)"
