    ; dcterms:source "Glutaric aciduria type 1 (GCDH; OMIM 231670): glutaric acid, 3-hydroxyglutaric acid, and glutaconic acid elevated in body fluids; plasma glutaric acid elevated (Boy et al. 2023, J Inherit Metab Dis — third revision diagnostic guidelines; PMC6498835, PMC11540565); Scriver's OMMBID | intervention: do(GCDH loss-of-function)"
