    ; dcterms:source "Saudubray, Inborn Metabolic Diseases; StatPearls MCAD deficiency (ACADM, OMIM 201450): dicarboxylic aciduria including dodecanedioic acid (C12) is a hallmark urinary organic-acid profile during metabolic stress; GeneReviews NBK1424 | intervention: MCAD deficiency (ACADM loss-of-function, OMIM 201450)"
