    ; dcterms:source "Saudubray, Inborn Metabolic Diseases; GeneReviews MCAD deficiency (ACADM, OMIM 201450): elevated free octanoic acid (C8 monocarboxylic) is part of the characteristic organic-acid profile; Lehninger Principles of Biochemistry Ch. 17 (beta-oxidation spiral, C8 substrate specificity of MCAD) | intervention: MCAD deficiency (ACADM loss-of-function, OMIM 201450)"
