    ; dcterms:source "Saudubray, Inborn Metabolic Diseases; OMIM 231680 (MADD/glutaric aciduria type II, ETFDH): urinary organic acids show elevated butyric acid among multiple short- and medium-chain organic acids; GeneReviews NBK558236 | intervention: Multiple acyl-CoA dehydrogenase deficiency (ETFDH loss-of-function, OMIM 231680)"
