    ; dcterms:source "Rinaldo et al., diagnosis of MCAD deficiency by stable-isotope dilution measurement of urinary n-hexanoylglycine and 3-phenylpropionylglycine (PMID 3054550); GeneReviews MCAD deficiency (ACADM, OMIM 201450): phenylpropionylglycine is a pathognomonic diagnostic acylglycine marker | intervention: MCAD deficiency (ACADM loss-of-function, OMIM 201450) [citations PubMed-verified]"
