    ; dcterms:source "Haack et al. (PMC5947294) and Yamada et al. (PMC6996175) — clinical, biochemical and genetic features of ECHS1 deficiency (OMIM 616277): elevated urinary 2,3-dihydroxy-2-methylbutyrate confirmed in all patients; Saudubray, Inborn Metabolic Diseases (short-chain enoyl-CoA hydratase deficiency) | intervention: Short-chain enoyl-CoA hydratase 1 deficiency (ECHS1 loss-of-function, OMIM 616277)"
