    ; dcterms:source "OMIM 231680 (MADD/glutaric aciduria type II); GeneReviews NBK558236; Saudubray, Inborn Metabolic Diseases: methylsuccinic acid (MSA) is part of the diagnostic urinary organic-acid profile in MADD (ETFA/ETFB/ETFDH deficiency); HPO term (MADD context) | intervention: Multiple acyl-CoA dehydrogenase deficiency (ETFDH loss-of-function, OMIM 231680) [citations PubMed-verified]"
