    ; dcterms:source "OMIM 276710 (tyrosinemia type III, HPD deficiency): plasma and urine show elevated 4-hydroxyphenylpyruvic acid, 4-hydroxyphenyllactic acid, and 4-hydroxyphenylacetic acid; Saudubray, Inborn Metabolic Diseases; PMC9259389 (LC-MS/MS validation of 4-hydroxyphenylpyruvate and 4-hydroxyphenyllactate in tyrosinemia) | intervention: Tyrosinemia type III (HPD loss-of-function, OMIM 276710)"
