    ; dcterms:source "Harrison's PIM, The Porphyrias (PCT: UROD deficiency, elevated plasma porphyrins); StatPearls NBK563209 (porphyria cutanea tarda: elevated plasma/urine porphyrins, predominantly uroporphyrin and heptacarboxylporphyrin). | intervention: UROD (uroporphyrinogen decarboxylase) loss-of-function (porphyria cutanea tarda, OMIM 176100)"
