    ; dcterms:source "Germline C1GALT1C1 mutations cause multisystem chaperonopathy with Tn-antigen accumulation. Ju et al. PMID 18537974 (New mutations in C1GALT1C1 in Tn-positive phenotype). | intervention: do(C1GALT1C1 LoF) — genetic loss-of-function of COSMC chaperone [citations PubMed-verified]"
