    ; pmo:mechanism "Asparagine synthetase (ASNS) catalyzes the ATP-dependent amidation of aspartate to asparagine using glutamine as the nitrogen donor; de novo asparagine synthesis is the primary source of asparagine in the CNS; ASNS deficiency severely depletes plasma and CSF asparagine."
    .
