    ; pmo:mechanism "GABA transaminase (ABAT) catabolises GABA to succinic semialdehyde; higher enzyme activity consumes GABA, lowering the CSF pool. LoF (GABA-transaminase deficiency, ABAT) causes GABA accumulation in brain and CSF."
