    ; pmo:causalEvidence "genetic_lof_gof"
    ; dcterms:source "OMIM 212140 (systemic primary carnitine deficiency; skeletal myopathy and cardiomyopathy from tissue carnitine depletion); GeneReviews NBK84551 (muscle carnitine depletion by OCTN2 deficiency) | intervention: SLC22A5 LoF (systemic primary carnitine deficiency)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "OCTN2 is highly expressed in skeletal muscle and heart for cellular carnitine uptake; SLC22A5 LoF depletes muscle carnitine stores, causing skeletal myopathy and cardiomyopathy (the cardinal clinical features of primary carnitine deficiency)"
