    ; dcterms:source "GeneReviews NBK6816 (VLCAD deficiency, OMIM 201475; C16 palmitoylcarnitine elevated); Springer JIMD 1996 (effect of fasting/fat load on long-chain acylcarnitines including C16 in VLCAD deficiency) | intervention: ACADVL LoF (VLCAD deficiency, OMIM 201475)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "VLCAD oxidizes palmitoyl-CoA (C16) during long-chain mitochondrial beta-oxidation; LoF causes palmitoyl-CoA accumulation and conjugation to carnitine as palmitoylcarnitine (C16, CHEBI:17490); elevated C16 palmitoylcarnitine is part of the VLCAD deficiency acylcarnitine profile and also elevated in CPT2/CACT deficiency"
