    ; dcterms:source "VLCAD deficiency (OMIM 201475): Harrison's Principles of Internal Medicine 'Inherited disorders of fatty acid metabolism'; Lehninger Principles of Biochemistry Ch. 17 (beta-oxidation); PMC8110899 (Very Long-Chain Acyl-CoA Dehydrogenase Deficiency, pediatric screening data) | intervention: loss-of-function of ACADVL gene (VLCAD deficiency, OMIM 201475)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "VLCAD is the rate-limiting enzyme in mitochondrial beta-oxidation of long-chain (C14-C20) fatty acids; reduced VLCAD activity impairs oxidative flux of long-chain fatty acids, causing elevation of plasma long-chain fatty acid species"
    .
