    ; dcterms:source "CACT deficiency (OMIM 212138): GeneReviews NBK582032 ('low free carnitine and elevation of long-chain acyl-carnitines including C16:0, C18:1 and C18:2'); Schuler et al. MDPI J Clin Med 2021 | intervention: loss-of-function of SLC25A20 gene (CACT deficiency, OMIM 212138)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "CACT (SLC25A20) transports long-chain acylcarnitines (including linoleoylcarnitine C18:2) across the inner mitochondrial membrane into the matrix; reduced CACT activity strands linoleoylcarnitine in the cytosol and plasma (CACT deficiency specifically elevates C18:2 acylcarnitine)"
    .
