    ; pmo:mechanism "HADH processes medium-chain 3-hydroxyacyl-CoA substrates including 3-hydroxyhexanoyl-CoA (C6-OH-CoA); reduced HADH activity allows 3-hydroxyhexanoyl-CoA to accumulate and be esterified to carnitine, elevating plasma 3-hydroxyhexanoylcarnitine (C6-OH)"
    .
