    ; dcterms:source "LCHAD/MTP deficiency (OMIM 609016): GeneReviews NBK583531; PMC10531771 (New Acylcarnitine Ratio as Reliable Indicator of LCHAD deficiency, including 3-OH species profile); Schuler et al. MDPI J Clin Med 2021 | intervention: loss-of-function of HADHA gene (LCHAD/MTP deficiency, OMIM 609016)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "LCHAD (HADHA) processes long-chain polyunsaturated 3-hydroxyacyl-CoA intermediates including 3-hydroxylinoleoyl-CoA (C18:2-OH-CoA); reduced LCHAD/MTP activity causes 3-hydroxylinoleoylcarnitine (C18:2-OH) to accumulate in plasma"
    .
