    ; pmo:mechanism "active phosphorylase kinase phosphorylates and activates glycogen phosphorylase (quality: PHK activity → disposition: phosphotransfer competence → process: phosphorylation of Ser-14 on glycogen phosphorylase → quality: glycogen phosphorylase catalytic activity)"
    .
