    ; dcterms:source "Wevers et al., J Inherit Metab Dis 2019 (SLC28A1/CNT1 biallelic LoF causes a novel inborn error of metabolism with high urinary uridine and cytidine excretion, PMID 30847922); OMIM *606207. | intervention: do(SLC28A1 LoF) — renal uridine reabsorption fails; urinary uridine rises [citations PubMed-verified]"
