    ; pmo:mechanism "GALNS (N-acetylgalactosamine-6-sulfatase) cleaves 6-O-sulfate from GalNAc-6S residues in keratan sulfate and chondroitin-6-sulfate. Keratan sulfate is the primary storage substrate when GALNS is deficient — Morquio-A syndrome (MPS IVA)"
    .
