    ; pmo:mechanism "GLB1 also cleaves beta-galactose from keratan sulfate and lactosylceramide. GLB1 deficiency (Morquio-B / MPS IVB) causes keratan sulfate accumulation — skeletal phenotype without neurodegeneration; enzyme activity inversely predicts keratan sulfate content."
