    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/oxygen_delivery> obo:RO_0002305 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/tissue_o2_extraction> .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Aoxygen_delivery%3Anegative%3Atissue_o2_extraction> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/oxygen_delivery> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/tissue_o2_extraction> ; pmo:sign "-"
    ; pmo:causalEvidence "curated_mechanistic"
    ; dcterms:source "If, for example, O2 delivery declines, while tissue O2 utilization remains constant, oxygen extraction from the blood must increase to meet the metabolic needs"
    ; pmo:mechanism "when O2 delivery falls at constant tissue utilization, O2 extraction from blood must rise to meet metabolic needs"
    .
