    ; pmo:mechanism "FGF23 (via renal alpha-klotho) downregulates proximal-tubule NaPi-IIa/IIc cotransporters -> phosphaturia"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/fgf23> obo:RO_0002305 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/calcitriol> .
