    ; pmo:causalEvidence "genetic_lof_gof"
    ; dcterms:source "Shimada et al., J Clin Invest 2004, PMID 14966565, DOI 10.1172/JCI19081: Fgf23-null mice had elevated calcitriol and renal CYP27B1 expression; Shimada et al., J Bone Miner Res 2004, PMID 15040831, DOI 10.1359/JBMR.0301264: recombinant FGF23 lowered calcitriol, suppressed CYP27B1, and induced CYP24A1."
    ; pmo:mechanism "FGF23 inhibits renal 1-alpha-hydroxylase (CYP27B1) and induces 24-hydroxylase (CYP24A1), lowering calcitriol"
    .
