    ; pmo:mechanism "pulsatile GnRH stimulates pituitary gonadotroph FSH secretion; exogenous pulsatile GnRH treatment restores normal gonadotropin secretion and testis function in CHH"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/pituitary_lh_secretion> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/lh> .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Apituitary_lh_secretion%3Apositive%3Alh> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/pituitary_lh_secretion> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/lh> ; pmo:sign "+"
