    ; pmo:mechanism "Estrogens induce hepatic LDL receptor expression → increased LDL uptake → lower plasma LDL cholesterol"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_beta_hcg> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/estradiol> .
