    ; pmo:mechanism "ANP-driven natriuresis and diuresis reduce total circulating volume; combined with vasodilation, ANP achieves net blood volume reduction."
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/acetylcholinesterase_activity> obo:RO_0002305 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/synaptic_ach_concentration> .
