    ; pmo:mechanism "OAT1 (SLC22A6) in the proximal tubule S2 segment secretes urate from peritubular blood into tubular lumen for urinary excretion. Inhibition of OAT1 transport activity reduces tubular urate secretion, resulting in net urate retention and elevated plasma uric acid concentration."
    .
