    ; pmo:mechanism "AKT1 (RAC-alpha kinase) is activated by upstream PI3K signalling (e.g. shear stress, insulin, VEGF) and phosphorylates eNOS (NOS3) at Ser1177, displacing the inhibitory calmodulin and activating NO synthesis. Decreased AKT/eNOS signalling reduces eNOS phosphorylation at Ser1177, impairing NO production."
    .
