    ; pmo:mechanism "RHEA:15889 (EC 3.5.1.2): L-glutamine + H2O = L-glutamate + NH4(+); glutamine is the substrate; impaired neuronal/glial glutaminase causes CNS glutamine accumulation detectable in CSF"
    .
