    ; dcterms:source "\"the alveolar ventilation can be obtained by dividing the CO2 output by the alveolar fractional concentration of this gas\" ... \"PCO2 ... is proportional to the fractional concentration of the gas in the alveoli\" (West's Respiratory Physiology, 11th ed., ch 2)"
