    ; dcterms:source "\"the P O2 may not reach that of alveolar gas before the red blood cell leaves the pulmonary capillary. In this case, a measurable difference between alveolar gas and end-capillary blood for P O2 may occur\" (West's Respiratory Physiology, 11th ed., ch 3)"
