    ; pmo:causalEvidence "perturbation"
    ; dcterms:source "A reduction in arterial blood pH stimulates ventilation... in experimental animals in which it is possible to reduce the pH at a constant PCO2, the stimulus to ventilation can be convincingly demonstrated"
