    ; pmo:causalEvidence "perturbation"
    ; dcterms:source "The main reflex effect of stimulating these receptors is a slowing of respiratory frequency due to an increase in expiratory time... bilateral vagotomy, which removes the input of these receptors, causes slow, deep breathing in most animals"
