    ; pmo:causalEvidence "curated_mechanistic"
    ; dcterms:source "\"The increase in cardiac output is associated with elevations of both the pulmonary arterial and pulmonary venous pressures...\" (West's Respiratory Physiology, 11th ed., ch 9)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "greater flow through the pulmonary vascular bed raises pulmonary arterial pressure"
    .
