    ; pmo:causalEvidence "curated_mechanistic"
    ; dcterms:source "\"The hypertension is exaggerated by the polycythemia, which raises the viscosity of the blood.\" (West's Respiratory Physiology, 11th ed., ch 9)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "higher blood viscosity increases resistance to flow through the pulmonary circulation, raising pulmonary vascular resistance/pressure"
    .
