    ; pmo:mechanism "raised left atrial pressure presses the flap valve of the foramen ovale shut, reducing patency"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/capillary_permeability> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/pulmonary_interstitial_fluid_volume> .
