    ; pmo:causalEvidence "curated_mechanistic"
    ; dcterms:source "\"This can be explained by the increased lung recoil and the increased radial traction holding the airways open\" (West's Respiratory Physiology, 11th ed., ch 10)"
    ; pmo:mechanism "increased lung elastic recoil exerts radial traction on the surrounding airways, holding them open (larger calibre) and thereby lowering airway resistance"
    .
