    ; pmo:causalEvidence "genetic_lof_gof"
    ; dcterms:source "\"inactivating mutations of the genes encoding for neurokinin B or the neurokinin B receptor, NK3R, results in hypogonadotropic hypogonadism\" and \"the tachykinin neurokinin B, which stimulates kisspeptin secretion\" Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 7, p 166-167"
    ; pmo:mechanism "neurokinin B co-expressed in KNDy neurons stimulates pulsatile kisspeptin secretion via NK3R autoreceptors; NK3R/NKB gene mutations cause hypogonadotropic hypogonadism"
