    ; pmo:causalEvidence "pharmacological"
    ; dcterms:source "\"significant shift in lipoprotein metabolism to a less atherogenic profile with improvements in the cholesterol and in HDL-cholesterol ratio\" and Table 8.6 \"High LDL and low HDL cholesterol → Improve\"; Fig 8.20 shows LDL-C falls from 3.89 to 3.22 mmol/L over 10 years of GH therapy. Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 8, p. 205"
    ; pmo:mechanism "GH upregulates hepatic LDL receptor → reduced plasma LDL"
    .
