    ; pmo:causalEvidence "genetic_lof_gof"
    ; dcterms:source "\"The condition arises because of defective conversion of 17OHP to 11-deoxycortisol. Reduced cortisol biosynthesis results in reduced negative feedback drive and increased ACTH secretion.\" Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 15, p. 529"
    ; pmo:mechanism "CYP21A2 catalyses conversion of 17-hydroxyprogesterone to 11-deoxycortisol (penultimate step to cortisol); LoF blocks cortisol synthesis in zona fasciculata"
    .
