    ; pmo:causalEvidence "curated_mechanistic"
    ; dcterms:source "\"Hypogonadotropic hypogonadism in male patients is a consequence of increased aromatization of adrenal androgens, in particular androstenedione to estrone, resulting in suppression of pituitary LH and FSH secretion.\" Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 15, p 533"
