<https://w3id.org/physiomap/edge/causal/influence%3Aplasma_catecholamines%3Apositive%3Amyocardial_contractility> a pmo:CausalRelation ; pmo:hasSource <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/plasma_catecholamines> ; pmo:hasTarget <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/myocardial_contractility> ; pmo:sign "+"
    ; pmo:causalEvidence "pharmacological"
    ; dcterms:source "\"Catecholamines affect many cardiovascular and metabolic processes. They increase the heart rate, blood pressure, myocardial contractility, and cardiac conduction velocity.\" Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 16, p 543"
