    ; pmo:causalEvidence "curated_mechanistic"
    ; dcterms:source "\"The mineralocorticoid effect of increased circulating levels of DOC also decreases renin and aldosterone secretion.\" Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 16, p. 571"
