    ; pmo:causalEvidence "pharmacological"
    ; dcterms:source "\"growth acceleration may occur in such children with GH or IGF1 therapy\" and children with GH insensitivity (low IGF1 despite high GH) have profound short stature, reversed by rhIGF1 administration. Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 25"
