    ; pmo:causalEvidence "perturbation"
    ; dcterms:source "\"Suppression of GABA inhibition during this period promptly results in reactivation of the suppressed GnRH pulse generator in the rhesus monkey\" — Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 26, p. 1041"
    ; pmo:mechanism "hypothalamic GABAergic neurons inhibit GnRH pulse generator; GABA suppression promptly reactivates GnRH secretion"
    .
