    ; pmo:causalEvidence "pharmacological"
    ; dcterms:source "Excitatory NMDA stimulates LH release in neonatal and adult rats, fetal sheep, and prepubertal and adult rhesus monkeys... NMDA evokes an LH pulse mediated by GnRH. Williams Textbook of Endocrinology, 14th ed., ch 26"
    ; pmo:mechanism "NMDA (excitatory glutamate receptor agonist) stimulates LH release via GnRH pulse generator activation"
    .
