    ; pmo:causalEvidence "mechanistic_model"
    ; dcterms:source "Saucerman et al. 2003 J Biol Chem 278:47997 (PMID 12972422); Saucerman et al. 2006 PNAS 103:12923 (PMID 16905651); Boron & Boulpaep, Medical Physiology."
    ; pmo:mechanism "PKA phosphorylation of L-type calcium channels, phospholamban, RyR2, and contractile targets increases cardiac inotropy and thereby cardiac output"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/pth> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/osteoclast_activity> .
