    ; pmo:mechanism "active JAK2 phosphorylates EpoR tyrosines and recruited STAT5 (quality: JAK2 activity -> disposition: STAT5 SH2 docking + phosphorylation -> process: STAT5 tyrosine phosphorylation, dimerization, nuclear import -> quality: pSTAT5 activity)"
