    ; pmo:mechanism "the central macrophage niche supports earliest erythroid progenitor (CFU-E) expansion via SCF/adhesion + iron provision (quality: macrophage support activity -> disposition: KITLG/VCAM1 presentation -> process: niche-supported progenitor survival/proliferation -> quality: erythroid progenitor proliferation rate)"
    .
