    ; pmo:causalEvidence "pharmacological"
    ; dcterms:source "INTERVENTIONAL (pharmacological + perturbation). Dexamethasone induces hepatic G6Pase and raises glucose output; mifepristone and liver GR knockout blunt the induction. DRAFT for domain review (primary citations pending verification)."
    ; pmo:mechanism "activated GR (with PGC-1alpha) drives G6PC transcription (quality: GR activity -> disposition: GRE/PGC-1alpha co-activation at G6PC -> process: G6Pase transcription -> quality: G6Pase expression)"
    .
<https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/pepck1_expression> obo:RO_0002304 <https://w3id.org/physiomap/node/hepatic_glucose_production> .
