    ; pmo:causalEvidence "genetic_lof_gof"
    ; dcterms:source "INTERVENTIONAL (genetic LoF). TMPRSS6 loss-of-function -> iron-refractory iron-deficiency anemia (IRIDA) with inappropriately HIGH hepcidin (cannot shed HJV; BMP-SMAD constitutively high) [Finberg et al. 2008, PMID 18408718]; Tmprss6 KO mouse shows high BMP-SMAD/hepcidin [Du et al. 2008, PMID 18451267]. DRAFT for domain review. [citations PubMed-verified]"
    ; pmo:mechanism "TMPRSS6/matriptase-2 proteolytically sheds membrane hemojuvelin, lowering HJV co-receptor density (quality: TMPRSS6 activity -> disposition: HJV cleavage -> process: loss of surface HJV -> quality: reduced HJV co-receptor activity)"
    .
