    ; pmo:mechanism "macrophage IL-6 -> IL6R/IL6ST(gp130) on CD4 T cell -> STAT3 (with TGF-beta) -> RORgt -> Th17 differentiation/activation (GO:0070102 IL-6-mediated signaling)"
