    ; dcterms:source "OmniPath ligrec TNF->TNFRSF1A consensus_stimulation=True (refs SIGNOR:17151142; NetPath:10634209) [citations PubMed-verified]"
    ; pmo:mechanism "macrophage TNF-alpha -> TNFRSF1A (TNFR1) on dendritic cell -> NF-kB -> DC maturation and further IL-12 output (GO:0033209 TNF-mediated signaling)"
    .
