    ; pmo:causalEvidence "mechanistic_model"
    ; dcterms:source "Sedaghat AR, Sherman A, Quon MJ. 2002. Am J Physiol Endocrinol Metab 283:E1084, post-receptor negative-feedback analysis (Figs 6-7); NOTE: the deposited model BIOMD0000000137 is the noFeedback encoding ('Sedaghat2002_InsulinSignalling_noFeedback'), so it is NOT cited for this edge. Mechanism corroborated by Liu Y-F et al. 2004, Mol Cell Biol 24(21):9668-9681 (PubMed 15485932): serine-phosphorylation of IRS-1 proximal to its PTB domain inhibits IR-IRS-1 interaction (negative feedback); Boron & Boulpaep, Medical Physiology (serine-feedback desensitisation). [citations PubMed-verified]"
    ; pmo:mechanism "downstream Akt/mTOR-S6K1 (disposition) serine-phosphorylates IRS-1 (process) -> reduced IRS-1 tyrosine-phosphorylation / accelerated degradation, damping its signalling activity (quality) [intracellular negative feedback]"
    .
