    ; dcterms:source "OmniPath SST->SSTR (P61278->P30874/P31391/P35346, consensus_stimulation = receptor engagement; SSTR is Gi-coupled inhibitory) | textbook corroboration: OpenStax Anatomy & Physiology 2e §anp-097 (17.10: The Endocrine Pancreas): pancreatic somatostatin (delta cells) inhibits insulin release [citations PubMed-verified]"
