    ; pmo:mechanism "Cx40 (GJA5) gap-junction coupling of extraglomerular mesangial cells to JG granular cells transmits the contractile/Ca2+ signal; rising Ca2+ in renin cells is inhibitory (\"calcium paradox\" of renin secretion), reducing renin exocytosis (GO:0002001 renin secretion into blood)"
    .
